@startuml usecase-02-planned-enblock
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam wrapWidth 170
title Use case 2 — planned-enblock\n"text model derives PICTURE DESCRIPTIONS ONLY,\nthen ALL of them go as ONE block to the image model"

actor User
participant "IllustrateDialog" as DLG
participant "ChatNodeComponent\nillustrate()" as UI
participant "LlmUseCaseRunner\n(env)" as RUN
participant "plannedEnblock\n(controller)" as UC
participant "planStoryboardDescriptions\n(shared)" as PLAN
participant "LlmOrchestratorService" as ORCH
participant "LlmTransportService" as XPORT
participant "Evaluators" as EVAL
participant "LlmLogService" as LOG
participant "LlmPostprocessorService" as POST
participant "ChatService" as SVC
participant "Provider\n(proxy)" as NET

== 1. Dialog picks the use case ==
User -> DLG : count(>1), planning ON, singleCall/pure\n+ style, storyboard rules
DLG --> UI : options
UI -> UI : pickUsecase(vars) → 'planned-enblock'\nbeginOperation('illustrate') → Stop ends the use case

== 2. Run: env ==
UI -> RUN : runner.run(chat, node, 'planned-enblock', vars)
RUN -> RUN : render = resolveImageModel(...)\nplan = resolvePlanModel(render, node)\n(plan = node's writing model → image-interpret task → render)
RUN --> UC : controllerFor('planned-enblock')(env)

== 3. Step 1 — planning (SHARED with use case 3) ==
UC -> PLAN : runPlanning(env) — text-only context + plan instruction\npicturePlanningInstruction(count, storyboardRules)
PLAN -> ORCH : completion({ plan model }, expect:'descriptions', stream:false)
ORCH -> XPORT : complete()
XPORT -> LOG : record/complete
XPORT -> NET : POST /chat/completions (text)
XPORT --> ORCH : raw
ORCH -> EVAL : evaluateDescriptions(raw)
EVAL --> ORCH : descriptions slot (ok | refused, reason)
ORCH --> PLAN : descriptions
PLAN --> UC : descriptions[]

== 4. Step 2 — ONE en-block render ==
UC -> UC : prompt = purePictures\n  ? purePicturesPrompt(instruction, desc, …)\n  : oneShotStoryboardPrompt(anchor, desc, …)
UC -> ORCH : completeImage(request, expect:'images')
ORCH -> XPORT : completeImage()
XPORT -> LOG : record/complete
XPORT -> NET : POST /chat/completions (or /images for image-only models)
XPORT --> ORCH : raw
ORCH -> EVAL : evaluateImagesResponse(raw)
EVAL --> ORCH : images slot (ok | partial | refused, reason)
ORCH --> UC : EvalSlots

== 5. Place — IMMEDIATELY as pictures are created ==
UC -> POST : storyboard slot (all N in one scene on success;\nper-scene refusal records on moderation)
POST -> SVC : editAssistant(chapter, illustration-N + prompt-N)\n(versioned) — attached immediately on the node\nillustrate was called for, as each picture is created
POST --> UI : activate(chapter.id)
note over UI
  One Stop press ends the use case via isOperationCancelled()\n— pictures already attached stay on the node.
end note

@enduml